@startuml
title Package: the promoter's rights at an occasion
[*] --> draft : promoter makes a package (53)
draft --> offered : promoter offers (57)
offered -[dotted]-> offered : promoter cannot offer it again (58)
[*] -[dotted]-> draft : sponsor cannot make a package (59)
offered --> agreed : sponsor buys it, alone or in a campaign (94, 95)
agreed -[dotted]-> agreed : sponsor cannot buy a sold package (97)
agreed --> [*]
@enduml
